	(text "Plug this with an XT60 short circuit cap in order to enable\nactive stabilization.\nIf at launch you are not confident in active stabilization \n(or believe something went wrong), please make sure to take out\nthe short circuit cap and disable it entirely, so that\nyour rocket can at least take off without systems that are\nknown to be defective actively operating."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
